---
title: Chicken Noodle Soup
tags: soup, chicken, easyrecipes
source: https://www.instagram.com/p/DB68_HGy5lF/
date added: 2026-09-27
ai_image: true
---

Season the @chicken breasts{4} with @dry jerk spice or Cajun{2%tbsp} on both sides. In a #pan{}, sear the chicken for ~{2%minutes} per side and transfer to a large #pot{}. Add @chicken stock or broth{3%litres} and place on medium heat. Once boiling, turn off the heat and let it cool.

In the &pot{}, melt @butter{3%tbsp} over medium heat. Sweat the diced @carrot{1%large}, @onion{1%large}, and @celery{2-3 stalks} for ~{3-4%minutes}. Add @garlic{6%cloves} and continue sautéing for ~{2-3%minutes}. Add @thyme{2 sprigs}, @bay leaf{2}, and @scotch bonnet{1}. Remove the chicken breasts from the stock and set aside.

Pour the stock into the vegetables and bring to a simmer. In a #separate pot{}, cook @dried pasta{250%g}. Shred the chicken by hand once slightly cooled. Add the shredded chicken and pasta into the soup pot and stir to combine. Taste and adjust seasoning with @salt{} and @pepper{}.

Finish with @parsley{2%tbsp} and @Parmesan{2%tbsp}.
